# Walkthrough Proyek RASIH Maternal (Production Status)

## Status Keseluruhan
- **Nama Platform**: RASIH Maternal (Risk Assessment and Screening for Integrated Maternal Health)
- **Tagline**: "Kenali Risiko, Lindungi Ibu dan Bayi"
- **Live URL**: https://app.novos.co.id/
- **Production Stack**: Laravel 12 + React 19 Inertia + FastAPI XGBoost Python 3 + Nginx + MySQL di Dokploy Docker container.
- **Status Pengujian**: 100% Lulus Uji pada Desktop & Mobile.

